    // darker muted blue (never a pale/grey tone) as real camera distance
    // grows (not offshore distance -- a different axis). Capped at
    // u_hazeMaxStrength so it only ever MODIFIES the water color -- it
    // can never approach a solid pale band at the horizon. u_baseBrightness
